# The vendored copy of hivelogic-live's draw.js is pinned by a sha256 in
# test/screen-annotate-vendor.test.js, so its bytes have to be the same on
# every machine. Without this, Git hands a Windows checkout CRLF and a Linux
# checkout LF, the hashes differ, and the drift test fails on one platform
# while passing on the other -- which reads as "the vendored engine changed"
# when nothing changed at all.
src/overlay/vendor/draw.js text eol=lf
